  "description": "Edit and synthesize word pronunciations in Windows applications using Microsoft WindowsMedia speech technologies.\n\nPronunciation formats supported includes IPA, SAPI, and UPS lexicon alphabets. \n\nUse LexiconKit in the Chant Developer Workbench to interactively create, edit, and test lexicon pronunciations before deploying with applications and VoiceXML.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation/lexiconKit.\n\nSamples are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/lexiconkit for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
